# Throwaway probes. All session long, checking a claim about the build has meant writing a
# one-off harness, running it once and dropping it — a habit worth keeping, since the
# alternative is reasoning about the code instead of asking it. The underscore marks them as
# scratch so they never reach the repo; the harnesses worth keeping have real names.
tools/_*.mjs
